OL,3,GNEWSAWill English status prevent a
OL,4,Awhisky wild west?
OL,5,
OL,6,FEnglish Whisky has been recognised as a
OL,7,Fdistinctive spirit with stringent rules
OL,8,Fon its production, just like those made
OL,9,Fin Scotland, Wales and Ireland. But
OL,10,Fvoices of dissent north of the border
OL,11,Fclaim the regulations are unfairly
OL,12,Frelaxed compared with those in
OL,13,FScotland. What does the oldest English
OL,14,Fwhisky producer, based in Norfolk, make
OL,15,Fof it all?
OL,17,FPut simply, only whisky made in England
OL,18,Fis allowed to call itself English
OL,19,FWhisky.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
