PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F377A1790403983
OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAWill English status prevent a
OL,4,Awhisky wild west?
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt joins the Cornish pasty (only to be
OL,7,Fmade in Cornwall) and the Melton
OL,8,FMowbray pork pie (you get the idea) and
OL,9,Fmore than 1,700 food and drink products
OL,10,Fthat have been afforded Geographical
OL,11,FIndication (GI) status by the
OL,12,FDepartment for Environment, Food &
OL,13,FRural Affairs (Defra).
OL,15,FThe new status came after years of work
OL,16,Fby the English Whisky Guild. It called
OL,17,Fit a "landmark achievement" for a
OL,18,Fsector which has grown from one
OL,19,Fdistillery in Roudham, Norfolk, 20
OL,20,Fyears ago, to 70 and counting across
OL,21,Fthe country.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
